DTEND:20260825T220000Z
SUMMARY:Career Hour
LOCATION:Tempe - SSV Amphitheater
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Tuesday from 2:00–3:00 PM at the SSV Amphitheat
 er for Career Happy Hour\, a casual drop-in session \ndesigned to help you
  navigate your career journey and connect with helpful resources. During t
 he first 30 minutes\, Career Services staff will \nhighlight career resour
 ces\, job search tools\, upcoming opportunities\, and practical tips for s
 tudent success. The second half of the session is \ndedicated to open Q&A\
 , where you can ask questions about resumes\, job searches\, networking\, 
 internships\, career planning\, and more. \nWhether you're just getting st
 arted or actively searching for opportunities\, Career Happy Hour is a gre
 at place to learn\, ask questions\, and \nget personalized support in a re
 laxed setting. No registration required—just stop by and join the conver
 sation!\n\nStaff in Charge: GCI\nCollaboration: ISSC\nVenue Booking Status
 : Booked\nRegister: https://career-asu.12twenty.com/events/30006101374499
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gci-fall2026-1-b8b3da77@asu-gci-events
DTSTAMP:20260812T215517Z
DTSTART:20260828T190000Z
DTEND:20260828T203000Z
SUMMARY:GCI: International Student Career Kickoff: Find Your People\, Find 
 Your Path
LOCATION:Tempe - MU Turquoise
DESCRIPTION:Kick off your career journey at ASU by finding your people and 
 finding your path! Join Career Services and the International Students and
  Scholars Center (ISSC) for an engaging event designed to help internation
 al students build connections and prepare for success in the U.S. job mark
 et.\nWe'll begin with an interactive networking activity where you'll meet
  fellow international students\, expand your community\, and connect with 
 peers who share similar career goals. **Please arrive on time so you don't
  miss this activity!**\nFollowing the networking session\, the ISSC Direct
 or will present on **Work Authorization & Job Hunting for International St
 udents**\, covering F-1 employment options such as CPT\, OPT\, and STEM OP
 T\, key employment regulations\, job search best practices\, and common mi
 stakes to avoid. You'll also have the opportunity to ask questions and rec
 eive guidance from ISSC and Career Services staff.\nWhether you're just st
 arting to explore your career options or preparing for internships and ful
 l-time opportunities\, this event will give you the knowledge\, resources\
 , and connections to begin your journey with confidence.\n\nStaff in Charg
 e: GCI\nCollaboration: ISSC\nVenue Booking Status: Booked\nRegister: https
 ://career-asu.12twenty.com/events/30006101375215\nSpecial Event Registry C
 ode: RITM1337343
END:VEVENT
