DTSTART:20261023T190000Z
DTEND:20261023T203000Z
SUMMARY:Build a Resume That Stands Out in the U.S.
LOCATION:Tempe - SSV Amphitheater
DESCRIPTION:Create a resume that gets noticed by U.S. employers.Join Career
  Services to learn how to craft a professional\, effective resume that hig
 hlights your skills\, experiences\, and accomplishments in a format employ
 ers expect.\nIn this workshop\, you'll learn the essential components of a
  strong U.S.-style resume\, how to tailor your resume for internships and 
 full-time positions\, write impactful bullet points\, and avoid common mis
 takes that can hurt your chances of landing an interview. You'll also rece
 ive practical tips on showcasing international experiences and transferabl
 e skills to stand out in a competitive job market.\nWhether you're creatin
 g your first U.S. resume or updating an existing one\, this session will h
 elp you build a resume that makes a strong first impression and opens the 
 door to new opportunities.\n\nStaff in Charge: GCI\nRegister: https://care
 er-asu.12twenty.com/events/30006101379233
END:VEVENT
